On Wed, 8 Jun 2005, Phlimm wrote:

> Have any of the YANI ever made it into an official release?

Some patches have made it into a release; for example, 3.4 has seen new
levels in the mines and an extended interface to the drop command.
Implementing an idea and publishing the patch is the best way to get the
DevTeam's attention. How long it takes the DevTeam to incorporate patches
or ideas does vary. For example, it was not before 3.3 that the player
could choose the character's gender without editing the configurations
file.

